OL,3,GNEWSAElbit raid trial collapses as jury
OL,4,Adismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial of five people accused of
OL,7,Fraiding a UK site of an Israel-based
OL,8,Fdefence firm has collapsed after the
OL,9,Fjury was dismissed.
OL,11,FQesser Zuhrah, 21, Zahra Farooque, 26,
OL,12,FKamran Ahmed, 29, Heba Muraisi, 31 -
OL,13,Fall from London - and Liam Mullany, 34,
OL,14,Ffrom Poole, were on trial for their
OL,15,Falleged role in a break-in at the Elbit
OL,16,FSystems UK Ltd factory on the outskirts
OL,17,Fof Bristol in August 2024. They denied
OL,18,Fcharges of criminal damage and violent
OL,19,Fdisorder.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
