OL,3,GNEWSAElbit raid trial collapses as jury
OL,4,Adismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Lees discharged the jury on
OL,7,FWednesday - a month after the trial
OL,8,Fopened at Woolwich Crown Court.
OL,10,FThe Crown Prosecution Service told the
OL,11,FBBC it would be seeking a retrial.
